{"text": " Robinhood stock tokens, stocks on a blockchain, trade around the clock, but the stock price exists only 6.5 hours a day. Trades happen against a pool of tokens. Liquidity providers fill it and earn a fee per trade. They are danger. A trader who knows the price just moved. We replayed 5.1 million real trades. While the market is open, a provider earns about $1 per dollar lost. At night up to 3. On weekends 3.8 to 19.5. Pools differ by fee tier and holders cannot see which pays. Picking a pool by hand is guesswork. Hooks, small programs inside pools can keep a hidden cut. 80% are flagged malicious. UpTick does the picking. It replays every pool and fee tier of each token and picks where liquidity pays. It only enters pools with no hidden cut or a maximum fee the pool enforces. We sent 200 trades over the maximum on a copy of the real chain. All 200 were rejected. For a holder, it is one deposit into a vault. Deposit NVDA and the vault earns the fees for you. UpTick Stock token yield, chosen by the chain's own data. The end. The end. The end. Thank you.", "words": [{"w": "Robinhood", "s": 1.0, "e": 1.68}, {"w": "stock", "s": 1.68, "e": 2.1}, {"w": "tokens,", "s": 2.1, "e": 2.78}, {"w": "stocks", "s": 2.84, "e": 3.54}, {"w": "on", "s": 3.54, "e": 3.74}, {"w": "a", "s": 3.74, "e": 3.86}, {"w": "blockchain,", "s": 3.86, "e": 4.36}, {"w": "trade", "s": 4.62, "e": 4.86}, {"w": "around", "s": 4.86, "e": 5.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 5.08, "e": 5.24}, {"w": "clock,", "s": 5.24, "e": 5.6}, {"w": "but", "s": 5.98, "e": 6.9}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.9, "e": 7.18}, {"w": "stock", "s": 7.18, "e": 7.42}, {"w": "price", "s": 7.42, "e": 7.76}, {"w": "exists", "s": 7.76, "e": 8.26}, {"w": "only", "s": 8.26, "e": 8.54}, {"w": "6", "s": 8.54, "e": 8.86}, {"w": ".5", "s": 8.86, "e": 9.24}, {"w": "hours", "s": 9.24, "e": 9.54}, {"w": "a", "s": 9.54, "e": 9.72}, {"w": "day.", "s": 9.72, "e": 9.9}, {"w": "Trades", "s": 10.84, "e": 11.18}, {"w": "happen", "s": 11.18, "e": 11.52}, {"w": "ag